],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Pitt County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. On the middle of the grids, August to September 2025 got 53% of normal and September to October 2025 got 49%. So far in 2026 on the middle of the grids, March to April came in at 51% of normal and June to July at 103%.</p>"}
